WEBVTT

00:18.810 --> 00:22.510
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:22.780 --> 00:28.020
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:28.190 --> 00:33.720
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:33.900 --> 00:39.060
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:39.230 --> 00:44.500
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:44.810 --> 00:50.250
<i>Will you ever know how I feel?</i>
<i>Will you ever know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:50.450 --> 00:55.880
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.050 --> 01:01.320
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:01.520 --> 01:09.230
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:20.980 --> 01:22.940
<i>Music Room</i>

01:23.480 --> 01:24.500
Shiokara!

01:24.810 --> 01:25.840
Rappa!

01:27.850 --> 01:29.550
Look who's here!

01:30.190 --> 01:31.480
Yo, baby!

01:31.720 --> 01:32.950
Thought you'd never show up!

01:33.020 --> 01:33.780
Woo hoo!

01:33.990 --> 01:36.960
Really, don't you ever
get tired of doing this?

01:39.390 --> 01:41.860
Hey! Sawada's a no-show again?

01:42.400 --> 01:45.130
Wait, I don't see Kinoshita either!

01:45.230 --> 01:47.930
Make sure you bring them
with you next time!

01:48.040 --> 01:50.370
They're not the only ones
who ditched this class!

01:50.470 --> 01:53.200
You can read that babe like a book!

01:53.340 --> 01:56.180
Yeah, but she's so stacked
I'll forgive her anything!

01:56.310 --> 01:58.940
All right, then, we're
going to warm up now...

02:07.360 --> 02:10.450
No question...
it was Yamaguchi...

02:10.630 --> 02:11.960
No proof, though...

02:12.060 --> 02:14.760
Just shut up and come over here.

02:16.000 --> 02:16.760
Kubo?

02:17.270 --> 02:19.330
And those other guys are seniors...

02:19.630 --> 02:20.970
Damn!

02:23.870 --> 02:28.830
<i>KYO-SAN'S KNOCKOUT</i>
<i>PERFORMANCE?</i>

02:29.410 --> 02:31.780
But-but that's extortion!

02:31.950 --> 02:33.280
Extortion?

02:33.480 --> 02:36.250
Nobody's telling you
to give us the money...

02:36.420 --> 02:39.790
We're just asking for a loan...

02:42.590 --> 02:45.030
Hey, I didn't even touch you,
dumbass...

02:45.130 --> 02:46.420
What a frickin' loser...

02:46.530 --> 02:47.520
Get the hell up!

02:47.660 --> 02:48.530
Hey...

02:50.060 --> 02:51.530
What the hell's going on?

02:51.930 --> 02:52.760
Well, well!

02:54.240 --> 02:56.030
Mr. Superhero, huh?

02:56.770 --> 02:58.140
Back off, asshole!

02:59.470 --> 03:00.740
Just like that, huh?

03:00.840 --> 03:01.640
Shut up!

03:05.380 --> 03:07.040
You little...

03:08.180 --> 03:09.080
Hey!

03:17.330 --> 03:18.550
.

03:24.530 --> 03:26.590
Good, you're not hurt.

03:30.670 --> 03:32.140
Hey, Yamaguchi!

03:32.270 --> 03:32.870
What?

03:34.210 --> 03:36.200
Y-you talking to me?

03:36.980 --> 03:38.540
Gimme a break...

03:38.880 --> 03:40.280
Uh, farewell!

03:41.250 --> 03:42.980
There she goes again...

03:43.120 --> 03:45.920
Why the cover-up, for chrissake?

03:54.960 --> 03:56.450
Jeez...

03:56.560 --> 03:58.500
I just narrowly missed.

03:58.800 --> 04:01.600
Just narrowly missed what,
may I ask?

04:02.570 --> 04:03.440
Oh, um...

04:03.540 --> 04:06.470
I just narrowly missed
catching a cold, you see!

04:06.570 --> 04:07.630
.

04:09.680 --> 04:11.370
If I didn't have my trusty mask...

04:11.480 --> 04:13.780
What a close call!

04:15.620 --> 04:19.050
If you didn't have your helmet,
you'd catch cold, too, wouldn't you!

04:20.490 --> 04:22.290
Gotta get ready for class!

04:22.390 --> 04:23.790
See you later!

04:23.990 --> 04:27.790
Really, Ms. Yamaguchi's
behavior is quite strange...

04:28.200 --> 04:30.290
Now the Vice Principal's on my case!

04:30.430 --> 04:33.800
I'll get fired if they find out
about the clan, gimme a break!

04:38.240 --> 04:39.500
Hey, guys!

04:40.510 --> 04:41.640
Yo, Kuma!

04:41.780 --> 04:43.710
You bought a scooter, man?

04:43.850 --> 04:45.840
Fat chance! I borrowed it.

04:45.950 --> 04:46.920
Hey, cool!

04:47.220 --> 04:48.680
Come on, gimme a ride!

04:48.750 --> 04:49.650
No way.

04:49.980 --> 04:51.380
What the hell? Tight-ass!

04:51.490 --> 04:52.580
You making us walk?

04:52.690 --> 04:53.590
So long, guys!

04:57.230 --> 04:57.920
Hey!

04:59.190 --> 05:00.590
Shin!

05:03.100 --> 05:05.860
I thought you ditched
music class and went home.

05:05.970 --> 05:07.200
What were you up to?

05:07.300 --> 05:08.600
Nothing, really.

05:08.770 --> 05:11.300
Did Yamaguchi mention
anything in homeroom?

05:11.410 --> 05:13.070
No, nothing special.

05:13.340 --> 05:15.740
Well, she did seem to be
in some kind of a rush.

05:15.940 --> 05:16.880
Really?

05:17.180 --> 05:18.410
Hey, did you hear?

05:18.510 --> 05:21.180
Kubo got roughed up by
a bunch of seniors, but...

05:21.350 --> 05:25.650
He says a 7 foot tall pro wrestler
in a mask saved his butt.

05:25.820 --> 05:27.520
Some crap like that.

05:27.690 --> 05:29.180
What the hell?

05:29.320 --> 05:30.290
Oh, never mind.

05:30.390 --> 05:31.880
Kuma, gimme a ride, will you?

05:31.990 --> 05:32.720
Sure!

05:34.130 --> 05:35.390
Hey, what's up?

05:35.500 --> 05:36.620
Look over there...

05:36.730 --> 05:39.860
There's a shady-looking car
parked out front.

05:44.570 --> 05:47.240
Holy shit, they look like bad news!

05:47.340 --> 05:49.280
Let's go home another way.

05:53.650 --> 05:54.840
Hey, hold up!

05:58.520 --> 05:59.210
Huh?

06:09.030 --> 06:10.560
Y-Yankumi?

06:14.200 --> 06:15.430
Huh?

06:15.570 --> 06:18.200
What the hell was that?
What's going on?

06:20.040 --> 06:21.480
Sh-Shin!

06:23.080 --> 06:24.510
Kuma! Let's go!

06:24.610 --> 06:25.480
R-right!

06:30.490 --> 06:33.510
Those guys had to be yakuzas, right?

06:33.650 --> 06:37.020
What the hell's Yankumi
got to do with them?

06:37.160 --> 06:38.460
Who knows?

06:38.590 --> 06:40.890
But I know she's hiding something!

06:43.770 --> 06:45.760
Shin, we're never gonna catch up!

06:45.870 --> 06:47.560
They've got a freakin' foreign car...

06:47.700 --> 06:50.970
The streets are gonna be
jammed up ahead. We'll make it.

06:55.910 --> 06:57.240
K-Kumicho!

06:57.610 --> 07:00.580
Kumicho, please go back to your room!

07:00.680 --> 07:04.170
Mr. Kuroda, your doctors
haven't discharged you yet!

07:04.620 --> 07:05.990
Get your hands off me!

07:08.120 --> 07:09.110
Grandpa!

07:10.320 --> 07:11.310
Ojou!

07:12.230 --> 07:13.320
Thank God...

07:13.730 --> 07:15.130
You got here in time.

07:15.260 --> 07:18.670
Grandpa, you can't just walk
out of the hospital like this!

07:18.800 --> 07:20.530
Please, go back to your room...

07:20.800 --> 07:22.000
I'm fine now.

07:22.100 --> 07:23.540
It's time I went home.

07:23.640 --> 07:25.970
Why are you so anxious to come home?

07:26.240 --> 07:29.010
He heard about the Nekomata incident.

07:29.110 --> 07:30.240
That set him off...

07:30.340 --> 07:30.970
I see...

07:31.810 --> 07:35.180
I should be there to
hold down the fort...

07:35.380 --> 07:39.620
Grandpa, you left the Clan
in my hands, didn't you?

07:39.720 --> 07:41.210
Don't you think I'm up to it?

07:41.320 --> 07:42.450
I'm not saying that...

07:42.560 --> 07:43.720
But the thing is...

07:43.930 --> 07:51.030
Kumicho doesn't want anything to
jeopardize Ojou's teaching operation.

07:52.900 --> 07:54.370
Grandpa...

07:54.670 --> 07:57.760
Kumiko, if it wasn't
such a volatile time...

07:57.870 --> 08:02.870
Just one full-blown turf war, and
the school could find out about you.

08:03.110 --> 08:05.910
You've always dreamed
of being a teacher.

08:06.080 --> 08:10.310
I won't allow anything to destroy
your dream because I've been ill...

08:10.850 --> 08:11.790
Kumicho...

08:12.250 --> 08:14.220
You're so fatherly!

08:14.320 --> 08:15.310
Or...

08:15.420 --> 08:17.820
Grandfatherly!

08:18.130 --> 08:19.460
Kumicho!

08:19.590 --> 08:20.990
Kumicho!

08:21.130 --> 08:23.150
Kumicho!

08:23.300 --> 08:26.530
Hey, come on, don't do this
in front of the hospital...

08:26.830 --> 08:29.170
Grandpa, you have
nothing to worry about.

08:29.300 --> 08:31.800
Those people are all
pretty dense, anyhow.

08:31.940 --> 08:32.530
OK?

08:32.670 --> 08:34.270
Just go back to your room.

08:34.440 --> 08:37.810
If anything happened to you,
then we'd be in trouble.

08:37.950 --> 08:42.040
Kumicho, I'll protect
Ojou's dream with my life!

08:42.220 --> 08:45.210
Oshima, I'm counting on you.

08:45.390 --> 08:46.950
Yes, sir!

08:47.120 --> 08:49.560
Come on, I said stop it...

08:49.990 --> 08:51.480
What the hell?

08:51.630 --> 08:53.360
Who's he to Yankumi?

08:53.590 --> 08:54.720
Beats me.

08:55.530 --> 08:58.690
It's like they're all on a
different planet over there.

09:08.080 --> 09:10.270
Man, gimme a break!

09:10.610 --> 09:14.840
You should've taken care of that
before you picked me up at school.

09:15.020 --> 09:19.250
Dense or not, if anyone had seen me,
I'd be screwed!

09:19.350 --> 09:20.750
I apologize...

09:21.320 --> 09:24.720
Especially if that
Shin Sawada had seen me!

09:28.260 --> 09:29.860
Ooedo Clan...

09:29.960 --> 09:31.060
No way!

09:31.300 --> 09:33.360
They're definitely yakuzas...

09:33.500 --> 09:34.900
I don't see any guards.

09:35.040 --> 09:36.560
They're pretty lax.

09:37.100 --> 09:39.400
Well, who'd go in there, anyway?

09:40.240 --> 09:40.970
Huh?

09:41.210 --> 09:42.730
Hey, Shin!

09:43.210 --> 09:46.510
Jeez, are you out of your skull?

09:48.820 --> 09:50.650
Hey, come on...

09:50.750 --> 09:53.480
If we get caught
there'll be hell to pay.

09:53.690 --> 09:55.350
You go home, then!

09:55.620 --> 09:56.960
Shin...

09:58.390 --> 10:02.490
Why's Yankumi mixed up
with these yakuzas?

10:02.630 --> 10:05.230
That's what I want to find out!

10:05.500 --> 10:06.630
Shin...

10:06.870 --> 10:09.890
I don't get why you're so interested...

10:12.040 --> 10:14.840
Aren't those Ojou's students?

10:14.940 --> 10:17.240
What are they doing here?

10:17.380 --> 10:20.470
Holy crap!
This is no place for them!

10:20.920 --> 10:23.890
Whoa! Isn't that Yankumi's dog?

10:24.020 --> 10:25.210
Oh, shit!

10:25.320 --> 10:27.310
Get out of here!

10:27.460 --> 10:29.950
D-dummy! Shut up, will you?

10:33.130 --> 10:35.530
The hell ya think you're doing?

10:35.630 --> 10:37.860
Do you little shits know
where you are?

10:37.970 --> 10:39.090
No...

10:39.500 --> 10:41.490
We're in deep shit, man.

10:41.840 --> 10:44.530
For chrissake, I warned you!

10:48.280 --> 10:50.210
What's all that racket?

10:51.610 --> 10:53.910
Come with me, you little punks!

10:55.780 --> 10:57.980
What the hell?

10:58.090 --> 10:59.950
What are they doing here?

11:00.120 --> 11:01.450
Man, I'm screwed!

11:01.560 --> 11:04.890
Did they know that I'd be here?

11:06.360 --> 11:07.920
If that's the case...

11:08.230 --> 11:11.260
I can just leave them
at Wakamatsu's mercy...

11:11.370 --> 11:13.660
Then no one at school
will ever find out!

11:13.770 --> 11:14.570
Huh?

11:18.940 --> 11:20.970
Get in there!

11:22.810 --> 11:23.870
Ow!

11:27.580 --> 11:30.480
Now, then, what the hell
were you doing?

11:30.580 --> 11:32.750
Ready to sing?

11:34.090 --> 11:34.950
Huh?

11:35.890 --> 11:38.260
Tetsu, what's with those two punks?

11:38.390 --> 11:43.160
These two were skulking around in
the yard, trying to cop a look inside.

11:43.260 --> 11:45.200
What the hell?

11:45.300 --> 11:46.600
You're teppodamas?

11:46.730 --> 11:50.600
Which Clan are you with,
you scumbags?

11:51.770 --> 11:52.800
Knock it off.

11:57.240 --> 12:01.340
You wouldn't be with the
Nekomata Clan, would you?

12:01.550 --> 12:03.180
N-no, we're not!

12:03.280 --> 12:05.450
We're just high school students...

12:05.550 --> 12:09.680
If you're just high school students,
why the hell were you roaming our turf?

12:10.860 --> 12:11.990
Wait a minute.

12:12.090 --> 12:15.090
There's someone here named
Kumiko Yamaguchi, right?

12:15.230 --> 12:16.320
What's that?

12:16.700 --> 12:19.360
What's Ojou got to do with this?

12:19.470 --> 12:22.300
You're dead, punks!

12:22.400 --> 12:23.340
Hold it!

12:26.110 --> 12:27.470
Ojou!

12:28.510 --> 12:30.440
Y-Y-Yankumi!

12:34.350 --> 12:36.940
Those two, they're my students.

12:37.250 --> 12:38.340
Students?

12:38.750 --> 12:40.690
You mean this one, too?

12:40.790 --> 12:41.590
That's right.

12:41.690 --> 12:45.290
They said "Ojou."
What's up with that?

12:47.860 --> 12:49.130
Shit.

12:49.230 --> 12:52.860
If they find out she's from a
Gokudo family, Ojou will lose her...

12:53.200 --> 12:55.690
My back's against the wall.

13:01.440 --> 13:02.880
All right, then.

13:03.010 --> 13:05.040
I guess I have no choice
but to come clean.

13:05.150 --> 13:06.080
I'll explain.

13:08.950 --> 13:10.110
Ojou...

13:11.420 --> 13:12.250
The thing is...

13:12.350 --> 13:13.620
What the hell?

13:13.720 --> 13:15.990
Still hanging around, are you?

13:16.090 --> 13:18.390
You goddamned Katagi Ojou!

13:18.490 --> 13:19.120
Huh?

13:19.290 --> 13:21.260
Showing up here's
not gonna help you.

13:21.360 --> 13:23.060
Now get the hell out!

13:23.760 --> 13:25.730
Whoa!

13:26.730 --> 13:27.960
Brother!

13:32.270 --> 13:34.610
You'll pay...

13:35.210 --> 13:40.710
You'll pay back every
last cent of your debt!

13:40.850 --> 13:43.110
I'm not shitting you!

13:43.320 --> 13:44.880
Take that! Take that!

13:47.250 --> 13:49.020
Take that!

13:49.120 --> 13:50.350
Brother...

13:50.590 --> 13:52.120
I get it now!

13:52.260 --> 13:56.920
He's putting on an act so these punks
won't find out who Ojou really is!

13:59.330 --> 14:00.300
Look at Brother...

14:00.430 --> 14:02.030
He's crying!

14:02.470 --> 14:08.470
He's doing this for Ojou
because he's so devoted to her!

14:08.610 --> 14:12.410
He's hitting her with tears
streaming down his face!

14:14.180 --> 14:16.650
Talk about chewing the scenery...

14:16.980 --> 14:20.440
Does he really think anyone's
gonna buy this soap opera?

14:20.590 --> 14:21.680
Please, stop it!

14:21.860 --> 14:24.260
Even if she owes you money,
that's going too far!

14:24.360 --> 14:24.850
Huh?

14:25.260 --> 14:27.590
Please, just stop it...

14:28.660 --> 14:29.990
He bought it?

14:30.830 --> 14:33.430
Huh? What's that you said?

14:33.600 --> 14:36.570
N-nothing, I didn't say anything...

14:36.700 --> 14:38.570
Spit it out!

14:39.610 --> 14:41.700
Well, if you're gonna make a scene...

14:41.810 --> 14:44.800
...I guess I'll let you off
easy this time!

14:45.110 --> 14:47.380
You're really pushing it, Kyo-san...

14:47.480 --> 14:49.970
All right, you three,
I want you out of my face!

14:50.080 --> 14:52.020
Yankumi, let's get out of here.

14:52.120 --> 14:52.780
Hurry!

14:52.890 --> 14:53.510
Uh, right...

14:57.190 --> 14:58.520
Brother...

15:12.040 --> 15:13.770
Jesus!

15:13.940 --> 15:16.340
I really thought our number was up.

15:16.440 --> 15:18.240
I mean, I nearly pissed my...

15:21.120 --> 15:22.880
You pissed your pants?

15:23.380 --> 15:24.150
No...

15:25.150 --> 15:26.620
Yeah, you did.

15:26.790 --> 15:28.090
Never mind that!

15:28.190 --> 15:31.250
Why the hell did you borrow
money from those creeps?

15:31.490 --> 15:32.650
Uh, well...

15:32.790 --> 15:33.990
You see...

15:34.090 --> 15:36.260
My late father, you see...

15:36.500 --> 15:37.230
Huh?

15:37.330 --> 15:40.700
You mean, your father died
and left you in debt, too?

15:40.870 --> 15:42.390
So did my dad.

15:44.200 --> 15:49.800
Wait, does that mean you're also taking
care of that old man in the hospital?

15:49.940 --> 15:51.910
What, you saw that too?

15:52.050 --> 15:53.240
I get it.

15:53.780 --> 15:55.440
You've got a load on your back, too.

15:55.550 --> 15:57.250
Yeah, I guess so...

16:00.020 --> 16:02.990
Okay. I'm gonna go get the scooter.

16:03.120 --> 16:04.720
Right, you do that!

16:11.700 --> 16:15.000
That was you in front of the
Kakita Clan's office, right?

16:16.100 --> 16:19.440
That night you were all
dressed up like a gokutsuma.

16:23.410 --> 16:25.240
So it was you.

16:28.050 --> 16:29.480
And that big guy...

16:29.820 --> 16:32.250
He was only hitting his own hands.

16:34.590 --> 16:38.720
Nobody but Kuma would ever buy
that kind of cheesy acting!

16:41.360 --> 16:42.560
For chrissake!

16:42.730 --> 16:46.170
Nothing ever gets by
this little punk, does it?

16:47.230 --> 16:50.300
With him out of the way,
no one would ever find me out!

16:50.400 --> 16:53.070
If I could just find
a way to silence him...

16:53.510 --> 16:56.410
Hey, what the hell?
What are you thinking now?

16:56.510 --> 16:57.530
If looks could kill...

16:59.710 --> 17:00.840
Hey!

17:01.380 --> 17:02.820
Thanks for waiting.

17:04.690 --> 17:07.880
Yankumi, don't let a little
debt get you down, okay?

17:08.090 --> 17:09.490
Uh, right...

17:09.920 --> 17:11.260
Cheer up, all right?

17:11.560 --> 17:12.580
Uh, right...

17:13.260 --> 17:14.090
See ya!

17:17.700 --> 17:18.890
See ya!

17:24.240 --> 17:26.040
Brother! Don't do this...

17:26.310 --> 17:27.370
Back off!

17:27.470 --> 17:29.310
What I did was inexcusable!

17:29.410 --> 17:31.610
I raised my hand against Ojou!

17:31.710 --> 17:34.480
I must atone with my death
or I'll never rest easy!

17:34.580 --> 17:35.950
Number Two!

17:36.080 --> 17:37.380
You were magnificent!

17:37.480 --> 17:39.040
Please don't die!

17:40.690 --> 17:42.420
They're still at it...

17:46.860 --> 17:47.790
Enough!

17:47.900 --> 17:49.520
You've acted yourselves out.

17:49.630 --> 17:50.650
Ojou!

17:50.800 --> 17:52.490
Thank you, Kyo-san.

17:52.600 --> 17:55.900
They bought your story, so
there's no need for you to do that.

17:56.140 --> 17:57.160
Ojou!

17:57.300 --> 17:59.270
I am unworthy...

18:00.310 --> 18:02.240
Ojou!

18:06.410 --> 18:07.440
That kid...

18:07.550 --> 18:09.240
What's his next move?

18:09.350 --> 18:11.880
I'm pretty sure he's no rat, but...

18:19.830 --> 18:20.520
Huh?

18:20.630 --> 18:22.490
Ojou, you're off to work already?

18:22.560 --> 18:23.330
Yes.

18:24.360 --> 18:26.270
Yo! Tetsu! Minoru!

18:26.400 --> 18:28.490
Get your butts out of bed
and in the kitchen!

18:28.600 --> 18:30.200
Worthless punks!

18:30.300 --> 18:32.710
Ojou is on her way to work!

18:32.810 --> 18:34.400
Hey, don't worry about it.

18:34.610 --> 18:36.010
I'm taking off.

18:40.080 --> 18:43.050
Have a good day at work!

18:43.820 --> 18:44.940
Kyo-san...

18:48.160 --> 18:50.950
I guess I'm more of
a wuss than I thought.

18:51.130 --> 18:51.850
What?

18:53.460 --> 18:56.950
It scares me to think I might
lose my job as a teacher.

18:57.200 --> 19:00.500
Well, of course it does.
It is your dream.

19:00.670 --> 19:01.360
Right.

19:02.170 --> 19:02.900
Bye!

19:15.080 --> 19:15.670
Huh?

19:20.690 --> 19:22.450
Pretty early today, huh?

19:22.590 --> 19:25.350
You thought I might blow
your cover, didn't you?

19:25.490 --> 19:28.790
If there's one thing I know,
it's that you're no rat.

19:29.530 --> 19:32.630
I'll keep your secret
if you tell me one thing.

19:35.070 --> 19:38.130
Why did you take
this job as a teacher?

19:38.310 --> 19:41.400
Wouldn't it be easier just
to run your family business?

19:48.420 --> 19:49.470
Probably...

19:49.880 --> 19:52.440
But you saw those
cugines of ours, right?

19:52.590 --> 19:55.020
Both of them got kicked out of school.

19:55.390 --> 19:57.190
Well, no shit, right?

19:58.190 --> 20:01.190
But I thought there should
be at least one teacher...

20:01.300 --> 20:03.460
...who wouldn't kick out
kids like that.

20:03.560 --> 20:04.620
That's all.

20:06.800 --> 20:09.270
Hey, don't just swallow that story.

20:09.400 --> 20:13.000
Maybe I'm just b.s.-ing you
so you won't rat me out.

20:13.870 --> 20:16.780
Don't sweat it,
I'm not telling anybody.

20:18.280 --> 20:22.680
I mean, if you got canned,
this place would be boring.

20:23.150 --> 20:27.380
I had a good time
trying to figure you out.

20:30.590 --> 20:32.180
That little punk!

20:34.530 --> 20:38.590
I came to put the kibosh on him
if worst came to worst.

20:38.730 --> 20:40.860
But that's a good kid there!

20:44.040 --> 20:44.870
Good morning!

20:44.970 --> 20:46.270
Hey, that looks good.

20:46.370 --> 20:47.600
Yo, Yankumi!

20:47.870 --> 20:50.370
Yummy! Pastries for breakfast, huh?

20:54.280 --> 20:55.210
What a loser!

20:55.320 --> 20:56.810
Could you do that a little louder?

20:56.980 --> 20:58.920
You skipping breakfast,
for chrissake?

20:59.020 --> 21:00.540
Are you on some kind of diet?

21:01.290 --> 21:02.810
Yeah, kind of...

21:08.300 --> 21:09.290
All right, all right!

21:09.400 --> 21:10.920
Get yourselves to class!

21:11.030 --> 21:13.260
We're going, for chrissake. Jesus!

21:17.200 --> 21:18.500
Hey, Yankumi.

21:18.610 --> 21:19.200
Huh?

21:20.040 --> 21:20.840
Take it.

21:23.340 --> 21:24.310
Kuma...

21:24.680 --> 21:26.980
Go on, take it already!

21:27.080 --> 21:28.010
But...

21:28.680 --> 21:31.850
You're skipping breakfast
to save money, right?

21:33.350 --> 21:35.020
Well, thanks, then!

21:35.560 --> 21:36.610
Kuma!

21:36.720 --> 21:38.450
Hurry the hell up!

21:38.660 --> 21:39.630
Right!

21:42.030 --> 21:43.000
Kuma...

21:43.560 --> 21:45.460
I'm sorry I deceived you.

21:46.430 --> 21:47.530
Damn!

21:47.670 --> 21:50.800
I love those guys,
every last one of them!

22:06.450 --> 22:16.450
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:17.500 --> 22:27.430
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:28.210 --> 22:37.910
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:38.220 --> 22:43.120
<i>On those days when</i>
<i>I am alone and cold...</i>

22:43.360 --> 22:48.260
<i>...I'll light a fire with</i>
<i>my own two hands.</i>

22:48.700 --> 22:53.630
<i>The treacherous mountains</i>
<i>are my chosen path.</i>

22:53.800 --> 23:00.570
<i>I'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>without a backward glance.</i>

23:16.820 --> 23:19.090
Nice save, Kyo!

23:19.190 --> 23:21.460
You gave a knockout performance.

23:21.560 --> 23:24.760
Ojou won't have to worry
about losing her job anymore.

23:24.870 --> 23:27.060
Hey, by the way, you know
that colleague of Ojou's?

23:27.170 --> 23:28.730
That lady teacher?

23:28.840 --> 23:31.860
She's a lot gutsier
than she looks, too.

23:32.010 --> 23:34.630
I'm telling you,
that's one tough lady!

23:34.740 --> 23:37.580
Next episode:
Shirokin Boys' Choir? Say What?!

23:37.740 --> 23:43.210
Ojou's gang can kick some
pretty good butt, can't they?
